===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Arceus|Nosepass|69}} from the {{TCG|Arceus}} expansion.
*'''Ram''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Team Rocket|Zubat|70}} from the {{TCG|Team Rocket}} expansion.
